  "description": "CR 702.128a embalm exiles the card for a white Zombie token copy with no mana cost, and a Clone of it keeps all three",
  "note": "Tah-Crop Skirmisher, a blue 2/1 Snake Warrior with a mana cost, so the white Zombie token with none differs on every excepted characteristic (CR 707.9b). Embalm is offered from the graveyard in a main phase, not in the end step (CR 602.5d), and not from the Skirmisher on the battlefield, which has the ability too but whose cost exiles a graveyard card (CR 113.6m). The card is exiled to pay the cost. A Clone of the token is the copiable-values tripwire: it takes the exceptions with it, where a Clone of the printed card beside it is the control. Displacement Wave for X = 0 reads the mana values: it returns the token (which ceases to exist, CR 111.7) and the Clone of it, both mana value 0 (CR 202.3a), and leaves the Clone of the card and the card itself.",
